<title>UK: TABLE-N Brown yr pretax rises 18.9 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-N Brown yr pretax rises 18.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 1, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		17.03		  vs 14.42</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.8		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.80		   vs 5.70</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    37.1		   vs 31.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   280.5		  vs 230.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British direct mail order shopping company is N Brown Group Plc. The 1996 year was a 53-week period, the company said. N Brown said sales in the current year were &quot;well above&quot; the previous year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
